Z||000002||WhiteFieroBlur||11-06-2001||12:16 AM||||Well kits are all over the place, I just recently posted about geting a loan for a kit. They are gonna be around 5,000 bucks and more for lambo type kits. I don't even wanna think about that with paint job and install. Just do a search at like yahoo or google and type something like fiero body kit and your gonna have like so many sites. Or check out candy apples cars at the V-8 Archie site they sell the fino and finale. These seem pretty nice looking.<P>Here let me do a quick search and see what sites I come up with.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.kitcar.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kitcar.com/</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.cybercars.com/fierohq.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cybercars.com/fierohq.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/8482/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/8482/</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.cadgraph.com.pl/fiero/fierokit.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cadgraph.com.pl/fiero/fierokit.htm</A> ||||reg||1
